  "review_notes": [
    "The waw of וְלֹא יָמִית takes the *that* the ASV writes for its recast clause, exactly as rule 51's `וְלֹא־תָקִיא הָאָרֶץ` → *that the land vomit not you out* does.",
    "*a deadly discomfiture* renders מְהוּמַת־מָוֶת attributively under rule 28; the supplied *a* joins the head noun under rule 15."
